cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "The Ocean's Clock: what tells a coral reef that tonight is the night?"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/atanasovmi/the-oceans-clock"
abstract: >-
  An exploratory R analysis of coral spawning timing. Historical reef
  observations are joined with NOAA regional heat stress and NASA Moon
  positions, then read against an aquarium diary with recorded zero days and a
  tank experiment. Built during the Applied Data Science blockweek at FHNW.
authors:
